   "off": 69267,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "アッシュ\r「理由をつけて館に軟禁\r  するよう",
   "en": "Ash\r\"I've told my father to find some pretext",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
